return ['domain'=>'woocommerce-multilingual','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 5.6.0','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-12T13:36:01+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'YEAR-MO-DA HO:MI+ZONE','x-generator'=>'WP-CLI 2.12.0','messages'=>['WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce','https://wpml.org/documentation/wpml-core-and-add-on-plugins/woocommerce-multilingual/?utm_source=plugin&utm_medium=gui&utm_campaign=wcml'=>'https://wpml.org/documentation/wpml-core-and-add-on-plugins/woocommerce-multilingual/?utm_source=plugin&utm_medium=gui&utm_campaign=wcml','Make your store multilingual and enable multiple currencies | <a href="https://wpml.org/documentation/wpml-core-and-add-on-plugins/woocommerce-multilingual/?utm_source=plugin&utm_medium=gui&utm_campaign=wcml">Documentation</a>'=>'让您的商店支持多语言并启用多货币 | <a href="https://wpml.org/documentation/wpml-core-and-add-on-plugins/woocommerce-multilingual/?utm_source=plugin&utm_medium=gui&utm_campaign=wcml">文档</a>','OnTheGoSystems'=>'OnTheGoSystems','http://www.onthegosystems.com/'=>'http://www.onthegosystems.com/','Language of the content to read.'=>'要读取的内容语言。','Currency for the returned prices.'=>'返回价格的货币。','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce detected an active cache plugin on your site.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 在您的站点上检测到活动的缓存插件。','Caching may cause currency display issues for your customers if you are using the multicurrency feature.'=>'如果您正在使用多货币功能，缓存可能会导致客户的货币显示出现问题。','To avoid this, set your cache plugin to not cache pages for visitors that have a cookie set in their browser.'=>'为了避免这种情况，请将您的缓存插件设置为不对浏览器中设置了 Cookie 的访客缓存页面。','Important: Action Needed for Your <b>Currency Switcher</b>'=>'重要提示：您的<b>货币切换器</b>需要执行操作','We detected that your site is using a <b>Currency Switcher</b> built with Twig templates. For security reasons, support for Twig-based templates will be discontinued in the upcoming version of WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 5.6.'=>'我们检测到您的站点正在使用通过 Twig 模板构建的<b>货币切换器</b>。出于安全原因，即将发布的 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 5.6 版本将停止对基于 Twig 模板的支持。','To ensure your <b>Currency Switcher</b> continues working smoothly:'=>'为确保您的<b>货币切换器</b>继续顺利运行：','- Switch to a PHP-based template - you can select one from the %1$sconfiguration page%2$s.'=>'- 切换到基于 PHP 的模板 - 您可以从 %1$s配置页面%2$s中选择一个。','- Need a custom solution? %1$sContact our support%2$s - we’re here to help you migrate safely.'=>'- 需要自定义解决方案？%1$s联系我们的支持团队%2$s - 我们将帮助您安全迁移。','We recommend updating your <b>Currency Switcher</b> as soon as possible to avoid disruptions when the new version of WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce is released.'=>'我们建议您尽快更新<b>货币切换器</b>，以避免在 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 新版本发布时出现中断。','Migrating your multilingual shop? With %s you can transfer your translated content to a new site, including cross-sells, up-sells, and product attributes.'=>'正在迁移您的多语言商店？通过 %s，您可以将翻译后的内容转移到新站点，包括交叉销售、追加销售和产品属性。','Looking to import your multilingual shop? With %1$s and %2$s in both your original and new site, you can export and import your translations automatically.'=>'想要导入您的多语言商店？通过在原始站点和新站点中同时使用 %1$s 和 %2$s，您可以自动导出和导入翻译。','WPML Export and Import'=>'WPML Export and Import','You haven\'t added any secondary currencies'=>'您尚未添加任何次要货币','Please add another currency to fully utilize multicurrency mode. If you do not need multiple currencies, you can disable this setting to improve your site\'s performance.'=>'请添加另一种货币以充分利用多货币模式。如果您不需要多种货币，可以禁用此设置以提高站点性能。','Configure multicurrency mode'=>'配置多货币模式','Review WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce'=>'评价 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce','Congrats on making your first multicurrency sale!'=>'恭喜您完成首笔多货币订单！','Want to help <strong>WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce</strong> plugin? %1$sGive us a review%2$s!'=>'想要帮助 <strong>WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce</strong> 插件吗？%1$s给我们一个评价%2$s！','Currency - no orders found'=>'货币 - 未找到订单','Invalid nonce'=>'无效的 Nonce','WPML synced translations for product-level changes only.'=>'WPML 仅同步了产品层级更改的翻译。','WPML synced translations for %1$d of %2$d variations.'=>'WPML 已同步 %2$d 个变体中的 %1$d 个翻译。','%d other variation was not checked because its data didn\'t change here.'=>'未检查其他 %d 个变体，因为它们的数据在此处没有更改。','If you\'ve made changes <strong>outside this editor</strong> (for example, retranslating an attribute term), use <em>%s</em> below to make sure every translation is current.'=>'如果您在<strong>此编辑器之外</strong>进行了更改（例如重新翻译了属性术语），请使用下方的 <em>%s</em> 以确保每个翻译都是最新的。','Force update all'=>'强制更新所有','Force update all variation translations'=>'强制更新所有变体翻译','You can switch to <em>"Always check all variations"</em> on the %s.'=>'您可以在 %s 上切换到<em>“始终检查所有变体”</em>。','WCML Settings page'=>'WCML 设置页面','(opens in a new tab)'=>'（在新标签页中打开）','Syncing all variations…'=>'正在同步所有变体…','Done — all variations synced'=>'完成 — 所有变体已同步','Sync completed for product #%d.'=>'产品 #%d 的同步已完成。','Failed — see console'=>'失败 — 请查看控制台','Error — '=>'错误 — ','Dismiss'=>'忽略','WPML verified %1$d variation × %2$d language on this save. None of them had changes that needed syncing.'=>'WPML 在本次保存中验证了 %1$d 个变体 × %2$d 种语言。其中没有任何变体需要同步更改。','That\'s wasted work. Switching to <em>"Only sync variations edited in the editor"</em> would make saves like this much faster — WPML will only sync the variations you actually changed and tell you what was skipped.'=>'那是多余的工作。切换到<em>“仅同步在编辑器中编辑过的变体”</em>会让此类保存速度更快 — WPML 将仅同步您实际更改过的变体，并告知您跳过了哪些内容。','You can switch on the %s.'=>'您可以在 %s 上进行切换。','Don\'t show this again on this site'=>'在此站点上不再显示此内容','Variation translation sync on product save'=>'保存产品时的变体翻译同步','Choose how WPML updates variation translations when you save a variable product. Affects saves in the WooCommerce product editor only — Translation Dashboard and Translate Everything Automatically always run a complete sync.'=>'选择在您保存可变产品时 WPML 如何更新变体翻译。这仅影响 WooCommerce 产品编辑器中的保存 — 翻译仪表盘和自动翻译所有内容始终运行完整同步。','Choose how WPML updates variation translations when you save a variable product.'=>'选择在您保存可变产品时 WPML 如何更新变体翻译。','Affects saves in the WooCommerce product editor only. <b>Translation Dashboard</b> and <b>Translate Everything</b> Automatically always run a complete sync.'=>'仅影响 WooCommerce 产品编辑器中的保存。<b>翻译仪表盘</b>和<b>自动翻译所有内容</b>始终运行完整同步。','Always check all variations'=>'始终检查所有变体','On every save, WPML checks every variation in every language and syncs anything that\'s out of date.'=>'在每次保存时，WPML 都会检查每种语言下的每个变体，并同步任何过时的内容。','Only sync variations edited in the editor'=>'仅同步在编辑器中编辑过的变体','WPML syncs only the variations changed in this save. After each save, WPML shows what was synced and offers a one-click full sync.'=>'WPML 仅同步本次保存中更改过的变体。每次保存后，WPML 会显示已同步的内容，并提供一键完整同步选项。','To translate custom WooCommerce email notifications, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'要翻译自定义 WooCommerce 邮件通知，请前往 %1$s翻译仪表盘%2$s。','Monthly on the %s'=>'每月 %s 日','Weekly on %s'=>'每周 %s','Cannot get exchange rates. Connection failed.'=>'无法获取汇率。连接失败。','Please note that the payment will be made in %1$s. Your total will be approximately %2$s, depending on the current exchange rate.'=>'请注意，付款将以 %1$s 进行。根据当前汇率，您的总额约为 %2$s。','Not yet supported'=>'尚未支持','Set the currency in which your customer will see the final price when they checkout. Choose which accounts they will see in their payment message.'=>'设置客户在结账时看到的最终价格货币。选择他们在付款信息中看到的账户。','Currency'=>'货币','Bank Account'=>'银行账户','All Accounts'=>'所有账户','All in selected currency'=>'所选货币的所有账户','PayPal Email'=>'PayPal 电子邮件','Merchant ID'=>'商家 ID','Client ID'=>'客户端 ID','Secret Key'=>'密钥','This gateway does not support %s. To show this gateway please select another currency.'=>'此网关不支持 %s。要显示此网关，请选择另一种货币。','WPML could not read this payment from PayPal, so no refund was sent. Please try the refund again.'=>'WPML 无法从 PayPal 读取此付款，因此未发送退款。请再次尝试