ot saved. Try again.'=>'设置未保存。请重试。','Cancel'=>'取消','Save'=>'保存','Currency available in'=>'货币可用范围','All countries'=>'所有国家/地区','All countries except: '=>'除以下国家/地区外的所有国家/地区： ','All countries except...'=>'除以下国家/地区外的所有国家/地区...','Specific countries'=>'特定国家/地区','Show currencies based on'=>'显示货币依据','You need the WPML plugin to make your store multilingual and display currencies based on site language. Don\'t have it yet?'=>'您需要 WPML 插件来使您的商店支持多语言并根据站点语言显示货币。还没有吗？','Purchase WPML now'=>'立即购买 WPML','Site Language'=>'站点语言','Client Location'=>'客户位置','Location based'=>'基于位置','WooCommerce integrates with MaxMind Geolocation to reliably determine the location of your customers.'=>'WooCommerce 与 MaxMind Geolocation 集成，以可靠地确定客户的位置。','Great! Now you can use Geolocation to determine default currency for chosen languages. You can edit that key in '=>'太棒了！现在您可以使用地理定位来确定所选语言的默认货币。您可以在 ','WooCommerce settings page.'=>'WooCommerce 设置页面中编辑该密钥。','MaxMind Licence Key'=>'MaxMind 许可证密钥','Apply'=>'应用','Please note: without a free MaxMind key, your geolocation calls will be limited and your site performance may be impacted.'=>'请注意：如果没有免费的 MaxMind 密钥，您的地理定位调用将受到限制，并且您的站点性能可能会受到影响。','Learn how to generate a free license key'=>'了解如何生成免费许可证密钥','Set on %s'=>'设置于 %s','Country availability'=>'国家/地区可用性','All countries except'=>'除以下国家/地区外的所有国家/地区','Configure per country availability for this payment gateway'=>'为此支付网关配置每个国家/地区的可用性','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Error saving settings.'=>'保存设置时出错。','We noticed that you\'re using WooCommerce Gateways Country Limiter plugin which is now integrated into WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce. Please remove it!'=>'我们注意到您正在使用 WooCommerce Gateways Country Limiter 插件，该插件现已集成到 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 中。请将其移除！','To translate custom text for payment methods, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'要翻译支付方法的自定义文本，请前往 %1$s翻译仪表盘%2$s。','To translate permalinks for product taxonomies, go to %1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce → Store URLs%2$s.'=>'要翻译产品分类法的固定链接，请前往 %1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce → 商店 URL%2$s。','To translate product permalinks, go to %1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce → Store URLs%2$s.'=>'要翻译产品固定链接，请前往 %1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce → 商店 URL%2$s。','How to translate permalinks for product taxonomies'=>'如何翻译产品分类法的固定链接','How to translate product permalinks'=>'如何翻译产品固定链接','Translate WooCommerce products'=>'翻译 WooCommerce 产品','Translate shipping classes'=>'翻译配送类','Configure multicurrency for multilingual sites'=>'为多语言站点配置多货币','Translate endpoints'=>'翻译端点','How to translate this?'=>'如何翻译这个？','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce will use cookies to understand the basket info when using languages in domains and to transfer data between the domains.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 将使用 Cookie 在使用域名语言模式时了解购物车信息，并在域名之间传输数据。','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce will also use cookies to identify the language and currency of each customer’s order as well as the currency of the reports created by WooCommerce. WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce extends these reports by adding the currency’s information.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 还将使用 Cookie 来识别每个客户订单的语言和货币，以及 WooCommerce 创建的报告的货币。WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 通过添加货币信息来扩展这些报告。','Invalid currency parameter: "%s"'=>'无效的货币参数：“%s”','Invalid language parameter: "%s"'=>'无效的语言参数：“%s”','Product not found: %d'=>'未找到产品：%d','Term not found: %d'=>'未找到术语：%d','Using "translation_of" requires providing a "lang" parameter too'=>'使用“translation_of”也需要提供“lang”参数','Multilingual'=>'多语言','Multicurrency'=>'多货币','To run your store in multiple languages, you need to use the %1$sWPML plugin%2$s.'=>'要以多种语言运行您的商店，您需要使用 %1$sWPML 插件%2$s。','If you have it already, install and activate it. Otherwise, %1$sbuy WPML%2$s.'=>'如果您已经拥有它，请安装并激活。否则，请%1$s购买 WPML%2$s。','You will need either the Multilingual CMS or Multilingual Agency package to use WPML with WooCommerce.'=>'您需要 Multilingual CMS 或 Multilingual Agency 包才能在 WooCommerce 中使用 WPML。','You can still use the %1$smulticurrency features%2$s without buying anything.'=>'您仍然可以免费使用%1$s多货币功能%2$s。','%s translation'=>'%s 翻译','Translating %1$s? Use the %2$s table for easier translation.'=>'正在翻译 %1$s？使用 %2$s 表格以更轻松地进行翻译。','To translate product details, including their taxonomy, use this dashboard. If you need to translate taxonomy independently or adjust store and currency settings, visit: %1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce documentation%2$s.'=>'要翻译产品详情（包括其分类法），请使用此仪表盘。如果您需要独立翻译分类法或调整商店和货币设置，请访问：%1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 文档%2$s。','To translate this content, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'要翻译此内容，请前往 %1$s翻译仪表盘%2$s。','To see how to translate this text, save your changes here first.'=>'要查看如何翻译此文本，请先在此处保存您的更改。','Header alignment for translations'=>'翻译的页眉对齐方式','Automatically align email headers based on%slanguage direction (right-to-left or left-to-right).'=>'根据%s语言方向（从右到左或从左到右）自动对齐邮件页眉。','Off – use the "Header alignment" setting above'=>'关闭 – 使用上方的“页眉对齐方式”设置','On – align automatically'=>'开启 – 自动对齐','Introduction'=>'介绍','Store Pages'=>'商店页面','Global Attributes'=>'全局属性','Multiple Currencies'=>'多货币','Tour Data'=>'旅游数据','Title'=>'标题','Content'=>'内容','To translate the Method Title, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'要翻译方法标题，请前往 %1$s翻译仪表盘%2$s。','To translate Labels, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'要翻译标签，请前往 %1$s翻译仪表盘%2$s。','To translate custom product fields, save your changes here first, then go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'要翻译自定义产品字段，请先在此处保存您的更改，然后前往 %1$s翻译仪表盘%2$s。','Calculate costs in other currencies automatically'=>'自动以其他货币计算成本','Set costs in other currencies manually'=>'手动设置其他货币的成本','Bookings'=>'预订','Resources Label'=>'资源标签','Resources'=>'资源','Person Types'=>'人次类型','Person Type Name'=>'人次类型名称','Description'=>'说明','Resources label'=>'资源标签','To translate Resources, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s and send the associated product for translation.'=>'要翻译资源，请前往 %1$s翻译仪表盘%2$s并发送相关产品进行翻译。','To translate Person Types, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s and send the associated product for translation.'=>'要翻译人次类型，请前往 %1$s翻译仪表盘%2$s并发送相关产品进行翻译。','Booking currency'=>'预订货币','Composite Products ( Components )'=>'复合产品（组件）','Name'=>'名称','Composite Products ( Scenarios )'=>'复合产品（方案）','To translate global add-ons, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'要翻译全局附加组件，请前往 %1$s翻译仪表盘%2$s。','Product Add-ons Group "%s"'=>'产品附加组件组“%s”','Placeholder'=>'占位符','Options'=>'选项','Label'=>'标签','To translate per-product add-ons, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s and send the associated product for translation.'=>'要翻译单个产品的附加组件，请前往 %1$s翻译仪表盘%2$s并发送相关产品进行翻译。','Multi-currency settings'=>'多货币设置','Calculate prices in other currencies automatically'=>'自动以其他货币计算价格','Set prices in other currencies manually'=>'手动设置其他货币的价格','Here you can set different prices for the %s in multiple currencies:'=>'您可以在此处为 %s 设置多种货币的不同价格：','Product Bundles'=>'产品捆绑包','You can translate text for subscription products from the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'您可以从 %1$s翻译仪表盘%2$s翻译订阅产品的文本。','Subscription Price'=>'订阅价格','Sign-up Fee'=>'注册费','Product tabs'=>'产品选项卡','Heading'=>'标题','To translate custom per-product tabs, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s and send the associated product for translation.'=>'要翻译自定义的单个产品选项卡，请前往 %1$s翻译仪表盘%2$s并发送相关产品进行翻译。','Custom Tabs'=>'自定义选项卡','Tab Title'=>'选项卡标题','Quick Edit isn\'t available for product translations:'=>'快速编辑不适用于产品翻译：','- To edit this product\'s translation, use the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'- 要编辑此产品的翻译，请使用 %1$s翻译仪表盘%2$s。','- To edit the original product, switch back to the default language.'=>'- 要编辑原始产品，请切换回默认语言。','Multilingual Settings'=>'多语言设置','Multicurrency Settings'=>'多货币设置','It’s recommended that you translate products from the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'建议您从 %1$s翻译仪表盘%2$s翻译产品。','WCML'=>'WCML','Shows a list of the products that existed in the cart before the cart is reset on the front end after switching the language or the currency. It will be hidden when there are no products to show.'=>'显示在前端切换语言或货币后购物车重置前已存在于购物车中的产品列表。如果没有要显示的产品，它将被隐藏。','Products before cart reset'=>'购物车重置前的产品','Switching language?'=>'切换语言？','You\'ve switched the language and there are items in the cart. If you keep the %s language, the cart will be emptied and you will have to add the items again to the cart.'=>'您已切换语言，且购物车中有商品。如果您保留 %s 语言，购物车将被清空，您必须重新将商品添加到购物车。','Keep %s'=>'保留 %s','Switch back to %s'=>'切换回 %s','Reset cart option warning 1Because of some elements in your site configuration, when the users switch the currency or the language on the front end, the cart content might not be synchronized correctly.'=>'由于您的站点配置中的某些元素，当用户在前端切换货币或语言时，购物车内容可能无法正确同步。','Reset cart option warning 2It is recommended that you %s with the option to reset the cart in a situation like this.'=>'建议您在遇到此类情况时，通过重置购物车的选项来 %s。','configure WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce'=>'配置 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce','More details'=>'更多详情','Switching currency?'=>'切换货币？','Your cart is not empty! After you switched the currency, all items from the cart will be removed and you have to add them again.'=>'您的购物车不是空的！切换货币后，购物车中的所有商品都将被移除，您必须重新添加它们。','Keep using %s'=>'继续使用 %s','Proceed'=>'继续','Show reviews in all languages  (%s)'=>'显示所有语言的评价 (%s)','Show only reviews in %1$s (%2$s)'=>'仅显示 %1$s 的评价 (%2$s)','translated'=>'已翻译','Show original'=>'显示原文','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce is enabled but not effective. It is not compatible with  <a href="%1$s">WPML</a> versions prior %2$s.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 已启用但未生效。它与 %2$s 之前的 <a href="%1$s">WPML</a> 版本不兼容。','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce is enabled but not effective. Please finish the installation of WPML first.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 已启用但未生效。请先完成 WPML 的安装。','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce is enabled but not effective. It is not compatible with  <a href="%1$s">Woocommerce</a> versions prior %2$s.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 已启用但未生效。它与 %2$s 之前的 <a href="%1$s">Woocommerce</a> 版本不兼容。','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce is enabled but not effective. It is not compatible with  <a href="%1$s">WPML String Translation</a> versions prior %2$s.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 已启用但未生效。它与 %2$s 之前的 <a href="%1$s">WPML String Translation</a> 版本不兼容。','WPML support'=>'WPML 支持','Default taxonomies must be translatable: 1/6Some taxonomies in your site are forced to be untranslatable. This is causing a problem when you\'re trying to run a multilingual WooCommerce site.'=>'您站点中的某些分类法被强制设置为不可翻译。当您尝试运行多语言 WooCommerce 站点时，这会导致问题。','Default taxonomies must be translatable: 2/6A plugin or the theme are probably doing this.'=>'这可能是由某个插件或主题造成的。','Default taxonomies must be translatable: 3/6What you can do:'=>'您可以执行的操作：','Default taxonomies must be translatable: 4/61. Temporarily disable plugins and see if this message disappears.'=>'1. 暂时禁用插件，查看此消息是否消失。','Default taxonomies must be translatable: 5/62. Temporarily switch the theme and see if this message disappears.'=>'2. 暂时切换主题，查看此消息是否消失。','Default taxonomies must be translatable: 6/6It\'s best to contact %s, tell that you\'re getting this message and offer to send a Duplicator copy of the site. We will work with the theme/plugin author and fix the problem for good. In the meanwhile, we\'ll give you a temporary solution, so you\'re not stuck.'=>'最好联系 %s，告知您收到了此消息，并提议发送站点的 Duplicator 副本。我们将与主题/插件作者合作，彻底解决该问题。在此期间，我们将为您提供临时解决方案，以免您陷入困境。','and'=>'和','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce is enabled but not effective. It requires %s in order to work.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 已启用但未生效。它需要 %s 才能工作。','Please %1$sactivate %2$s%3$s.'=>'请 %1$s激活 %2$s%3$s。','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce is enabled but not effective.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 已启用但未生效。','Because this site uses the default permalink structure, you cannot use slug translation for product permalinks.'=>'由于此站点使用默认固定链接结构，您无法为产品固定链接使用别名翻译。','Please choose a different permalink structure or disable slug translation.'=>'请选择不同的固定链接结构或禁用别名翻译。','Permalink settings'=>'固定链接设置','Configure products slug translation'=>'配置产品别名翻译','wpml-config.xml file missing from WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce folder.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 文件夹中缺少 wpml-config.xml 文件。','Custom field %s configuration from wpml-config.xml file was altered!'=>'来自 wpml-config.xml 文件的自定义字段 %s 配置已被更改！','Custom type %s configuration from wpml-config.xml file was altered!'=>'来自 wpml-config.xml 文件的自定义类型 %s 配置已被更改！','Custom taxonomy %s configuration from wpml-config.xml file was altered!'=>'来自 wpml-config.xml 文件的自定义分类法 %s 配置已被更改！','We detected a problem in your WPML configuration: the %1$sproduct_type%2$s taxonomy is set as translatable and this would cause problems with translated products. You can fix this in the %3$sMultilingual Content Setup page%4$s.'=>'我们在您的 WPML 配置中检测到一个问题：%1$sproduct_type%2$s 分类法被设置为可翻译，这会导致已翻译产品出现问题。您可以在 %3$s多语言内容设置页面%4$s中修复此问题。','We detected that the %1$sproduct_type%2$s field was set incorrectly for some product translations. This happened because the product_type taxonomy was translated. You can fix this in the WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce %3$stroubleshooting page%4$s.'=>'我们检测到某些产品翻译的 %1$sproduct_type%2$s 字段设置不正确。这是因为 product_type 分类法被翻译了。您可以在 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce %3$s故障排除页面%4$s中修复此问题。','Downloading translations... Please don\'t close this page.'=>'正在下载翻译... 请不要关闭此页面。','Order language:'=>'订单语言：','All the products will be removed from the current order in order to change the language'=>'为了更改语言，当前订单中的所有产品都将被移除','Quick edit "%s" inline'=>'行内快速编辑“%s”','Quick Edit'=>'快速编辑','Your settings have been saved.'=>'您的设置已保存。','You do not have permission to perform this action.'=>'您没有执行此操作的权限。','Choose a file'=>'选择文件','At least one of these fields is required: title, content or excerpt'=>'至少需要以下字段之一：标题、内容或摘要','This translation job will no longer be assigned to you. Other translators will be able take it and continue the translation.'=>'此翻译作业将不再分配给您。其他译员将能够接手并继续翻译。','This field is locked for editing because WPML will copy its value from the original language.'=>'此字段已锁定编辑，因为 WPML 将从原始语言复制其值。','This is a translation of %1$s. Some of the fields are not editable. It\'s recommended that you translate products from the %2$sTranslation Dashboard%3$s.'=>'这是 %1$s 的翻译。某些字段不可编辑。建议您从 %2$s翻译仪表盘%3$s翻译产品。','Cart'=>'购物车','Checkout'=>'结账','Checkout &rarr; Pay'=>'结账 &rarr; 支付','Order Received'=>'订单已收到','My Account'=>'我的账户','Change Password'=>'更改密码','Edit My Address'=>'编辑我的地址','Logout'=>'登出','Lost Password'=>'忘记密码','View Order'=>'查看订单','Shop'=>'商店','To quickly translate this and other WooCommerce store pages, please run the %1$ssetup wizard%2$s.'=>'要快速翻译此页面和其他 WooCommerce 商店页面，请运行 %1$s设置向导%2$s。','To translate %1$s please use the %2$s translation%3$s page, inside the %4$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce admin%5$s.'=>'要翻译 %1$s，请使用 %4$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 管理%5$s中的 %2$s 翻译%3$s页面。','%d products left'=>'剩余 %d 个产品','Synchronization complete!'=>'同步完成！','Invalid taxonomy %s'=>'无效的分类法 %s','Some translated %1$s have different %2$s assignments.'=>'某些已翻译的 %1$s 具有不同的 %2$s 分配。','Update %1$s for all translated %2$s'=>'为所有已翻译的 %2$s 更新 %1$s','All %1$s have the same %2$s assignments.'=>'所有 %1$s 具有相同的 %2$s 分配。','Successfully updated %1$s for all translated %2$s.'=>'已成功为所有已翻译的 %2$s 更新 %1$s。','Product Base'=>'产品基准','Product Tag Base'=>'产品标签基准','Product Category Base'=>'产品分类基准','Product Attribute Base'=>'产品属性基准','Attribute Slug'=>'属性别名','Endpoint: %s'=>'端点：%s','You are 