e 别名（商店、产品基准等）。','Open Store URLs ›'=>'打开商店 URL ›','Go to WPML → Translations → Dashboard to translate Products.'=>'前往 WPML → 翻译 → 仪表盘以翻译产品。','Translate Products ›'=>'翻译产品 ›','Translate product taxonomies'=>'翻译产品分类法','Go to WPML → Translations → Taxonomy to translate product categories, tags and attributes.'=>'前往 WPML → 翻译 → 分类法以翻译产品分类、标签和属性。','Translate Taxonomies ›'=>'翻译分类法 ›','Products, media, downloads, reviews, cart and the variation translation sync — all in WPML → Settings → WCML.'=>'产品、媒体、下载、评价、购物车和变体翻译同步——尽在 WPML → 设置 → WCML。','Open WCML Settings ›'=>'打开 WCML 设置 ›','Configure currencies, exchange rates and currency switchers at WPML → Settings → Multicurrency.'=>'在 WPML → 设置 → 多货币处配置货币、汇率和货币切换器。','Open Multicurrency ›'=>'打开多货币 ›','Support'=>'支持','WCML status'=>'WCML 状态','Diagnostic checks for store pages, products, taxonomies, multicurrency and plugins.'=>'商店页面、产品、分类法、多货币和插件的诊断检查。','Open WCML status ›'=>'打开 WCML 状态 ›','Fix WCML translations'=>'修复 WCML 翻译','Safe bulk tools to sync product variations, galleries and stock; register missing reviews; create missing attribute translations.'=>'用于同步产品变体、图库和库存的安全批量工具；注册缺失的评价；创建缺失的属性翻译。','Open Fix WCML translations ›'=>'打开修复 WCML 翻译 ›','WCML configuration log'=>'WCML 配置日志','Read-only snapshot of the WCML configuration. Copy when WPML Support asks.'=>'WCML 配置的只读快照。当 WPML 支持要求时请复制。','Open WCML configuration log ›'=>'打开 WCML 配置日志 ›','WCML translation maintenance'=>'WCML 翻译维护','Advanced repair tools — only run when WPML Support asks you to.'=>'高级修复工具——仅在 WPML 支持要求时运行。','Open WCML translation maintenance ›'=>'打开 WCML 翻译维护 ›','WPML is installed on this site, so WCML\'s controls have moved into WPML. Pick the area you need.'=>'WPML 已安装在此站点上，因此 WCML 的控件已移至 WPML 中。请选择您需要的区域。','Translatable?'=>'可翻译？','Enable this if you want to translate attribute values with WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce'=>'如果您想使用 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 翻译属性值，请启用此项','Existing translations and variations associated will be deleted.'=>'现有的翻译和相关的变体将被删除。','Products removed after switching to %s:'=>'切换到 %s 后移除的产品：','Clear list'=>'清除列表','Products Synchronization'=>'产品同步','Configure specific product properties that should be synced to translations.'=>'配置应同步到翻译的特定产品属性。','Sync publishing date for translated products.'=>'为已翻译产品同步发布日期。','Sync products and product taxonomies order.'=>'同步产品和产品分类法的排序。','Products Media Synchronization'=>'产品媒体同步','Configure thumbnail and gallery synchronization to translations.'=>'配置缩略图和图库同步到翻译。','Display original images on the translated product front page if images not specified'=>'如果未指定图像，则在翻译产品前端页面显示原始图像','Products Download Files'=>'产品下载文件','If you are using downloadable products, you can choose to have their paths
                                            synchronized, or seperate for each language.'=>'如果您使用可下载产品，可以选择让其路径
同步，或为每种语言单独设置。','Add separate download files for translations when translating products'=>'翻译产品时为翻译添加单独的下载文件','Product reviews'=>'产品评价','Define how to display product reviews on the product page by default. The customer will be still able to filter reviews by language.'=>'定义默认如何在产品页面上显示产品评价。客户仍然能够按语言筛选评价。','By default, show reviews in all languages'=>'默认情况下，显示所有语言的评价','You can choose to clear the cart contents when you change language or currency in case you have problems in cart or checkout page'=>'如果您在购物车或结账页面遇到问题，可以选择在更改语言或货币时清除购物车内容','Switching languages when there are items in the cart'=>'购物车中有商品时切换语言','Synchronize cart content when switching languages'=>'切换语言时同步购物车内容','Prompt for a confirmation and reset the cart'=>'提示确认并重置购物车','Switching currencies when there are items in the cart'=>'购物车中有商品时切换货币','Synchronize cart content when switching currencies'=>'切换货币时同步购物车内容','This feature was disabled. Please enable %1$sWPML cookies%2$s to continue.'=>'此功能已禁用。请启用 %1$sWPML cookie%2$s 以继续。','Not sure which option to choose? Read about %1$spotential issues when switching languages and currencies while the cart has items%2$s.'=>'不确定选择哪个选项？阅读关于%1$s购物车中有商品时切换语言和货币的潜在问题%2$s。','Product Translation Interface'=>'产品翻译界面','The recommended way is using the WPML Translation Editor. It is streamlined for making the translation process much easier while also providing a much better integration with various WooCommerce extensions.'=>'推荐的方法是使用 WPML 翻译编辑器。它经过精简，使翻译过程更加轻松，同时还能与各种 WooCommerce 扩展更好地集成。','WPML Translation Editor'=>'WPML 翻译编辑器','Native WooCommerce product editing screen'=>'原生 WooCommerce 产品编辑屏幕','If you are using a page builder to design WooCommerce products, you should only use WPML\'s Translation Editor.'=>'如果您正在使用页面构建器设计 WooCommerce 产品，则应仅使用 WPML 的翻译编辑器。','OK (translate with the WordPress editor)'=>'确定（使用 WordPress 编辑器翻译）','Cancel (stay with the Translation Editor)'=>'取消（保留翻译编辑器）','Set different slugs in different languages for %s on WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce URLs translations page'=>'在 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 商店 URL 翻译页面上为 %s 设置不同语言的不同别名','To translate the attribute slug, please set the option "Enable archives?" for the attribute %s in WooCommerce'=>'要翻译属性别名，请在 WooCommerce 中为属性 %s 设置选项“启用归档？”','Synchronize attributes and update product variations'=>'同步属性并更新产品变体','This will automatically generate variations for translated products corresponding to recently translated attributes.'=>'这将为最近翻译的属性所对应的已翻译产品自动生成变体。','Currently, there are %s variations that need to be created.'=>'当前有 %s 个变体需要创建。','Synchronize %s assignment in content'=>'同步内容中的 %s 分配','This action lets you automatically apply the %s taxonomy to your content in different languages. It will scan the original content and apply the same taxonomy to translated content.'=>'此操作可让您自动将 %s 分类法应用于不同语言的内容。它将扫描原始内容并将相同的分类法应用于已翻译的内容。','Please make a backup of your database before using these tools'=>'在使用这些工具之前，请先备份您的数据库','There are <strong>%s product(s)</strong> in total.'=>'总共有 <strong>%s 个产品</strong>。','There are <strong>%s product(s)</strong> with variations.'=>'有 <strong>%s 个产品</strong>带有变体。','There are <strong>%s variation(s)</strong> in total.'=>'总共有 <strong>%s 个变体</strong>。','Synchronize data into translations'=>'将数据同步到翻译中','Synchronize product variations'=>'同步产品变体','Synchronize products image galleries'=>'同步产品图片库','Synchronize metadata for product categories (display type, thumbnail)'=>'同步产品分类的元数据（显示类型、缩略图）','Synchronize stock for products and product variations'=>'同步产品和产品变体的库存','Fix multilingual information'=>'修复多语言信息','Fix incorrect or missing translation links for product variations'=>'修复产品变体错误或缺失的翻译链接','Fix product taxonomies'=>'修复产品分类法','Set product types as not translatable and delete unwanted translations'=>'将产品类型设置为不可翻译并删除不需要的翻译','Create missing translations for product attributes:'=>'为产品属性创建缺失的翻译：','To translate product taxonomies, go to the %1$sTaxonomy Translation%2$s page.'=>'要翻译产品分类法，请前往 %1$s分类翻译%2$s 页面。','none'=>'无','Fix missing product reviews'=>'修复缺失的产品评价','Allow to translate missing product reviews'=>'允许翻译缺失的产品评价','To translate product reviews, go to the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s.'=>'要翻译产品评价，请前往 %1$s翻译仪表盘%2$s。','Cleanup tools'=>'清理工具','Remove unused custom fields from product and variation translations'=>'从产品和变体翻译中删除未使用的自定义字段','Run the selected tools'=>'运行选定的工具','Processing'=>'处理中','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce settings'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 设置','%s items processed'=>'已处理 %s 个项目','Processing...'=>'处理中...','Completed'=>'已完成','Something went wrong, please reload the page and try again'=>'出错了，请刷新页面并重试','Clear all colors'=>'清除所有颜色','Gray'=>'灰色','White'=>'白色','Blue'=>'蓝色','Border'=>'边框','Current currency font color'=>'当前货币字体颜色','Other currency font color'=>'其他货币字体颜色','Current currency background color'=>'当前货币背景颜色','Other currency background color'=>'其他货币背景颜色','Currency switcher style'=>'货币切换器样式','Core'=>'核心','Custom'=>'自定义','Allowed HTML tags: <img> <span> <u> <strong> <em>'=>'允许的 HTML 标签：<img> <span> <u> <strong> <em>','Template for currency switcher'=>'货币切换器模板','Available parameters'=>'可用参数','Default: %name% (%1$symbol%) - %2$code%'=>'默认：%name% (%1$symbol%) - %2$code%','Hide more'=>'隐藏更多','You can customize the currency switcher template using these parameters:'=>'您可以使用这些参数自定义货币切换器模板：','%1$s: Full name of the currency (e.g., “Euro”).'=>'%1$s：货币的全称（例如：“Euro”）。','%1$s: Standard symbol representing the currency (e.g., “$” or “€”).'=>'%1$s：代表货币的标准符号（例如：“$”或“€”）。','%1$s: Standard code representing the currency (e.g., USD for United States Dollar).'=>'%1$s：代表货币的标准代码（例如：USD 代表美元）。','Additionally, you can use HTML tags %1$s(img, span, em, strong, u)%2$s to customize the output when the switcher style is set to %1$sList of currencies%2$s, %3$sin line with official HTML standards for the select tag%4$s.'=>'此外，当切换器样式设置为 %1$s货币列表%2$s 时，您可以使用 HTML 标签 %1$s(img, span, em, strong, u)%2$s 来自定义输出，%3$s这符合 select 标签的官方 HTML 标准%4$s。','Currency switcher colors'=>'货币切换器颜色','Color theme'=>'颜色主题','Normal'=>'常规','Hover'=>'悬停','Select a preset'=>'选择预设','Widget area'=>'小工具区域','Widget title'=>'小工具标题','-- Choose a widget area --'=>'-- 选择一个小工具区域 --','Preview'=>'预览','Regular Price'=>'常规价格','Sale Price'=>'促销价格','Multi-currency is enabled, but no secondary currencies have been set. %1$sAdd secondary currency%2$s.'=>'多货币已启用，但尚未设置次要货币。%1$s添加次要货币%2$s。','Click to see the prices in the other currencies as they are currently shown on the front end.'=>'点击查看目前在前端显示的其他货币价格。','Show'=>'显示','Hide'=>'隐藏','Enter prices in other currencies'=>'输入其他货币的价格','Hide prices in other currencies'=>'隐藏其他货币的价格','Determined automatically based on exchange rate'=>'根据汇率自动确定','Schedule'=>'计划','Same as default currency'=>'与默认货币相同','Set dates'=>'设置日期','Collapse'=>'折叠','From&hellip;'=>'从&hellip;','To&hellip;'=>'至&hellip;','Please enter in a value less than the regular price'=>'请输入小于常规价格的数值','never'=>'从不','Automatic Exchange Rates'=>'自动汇率','Enable automatic exchange rates'=>'启用自动汇率','Exchange rates source'=>'汇率来源','Lifting charge'=>'手续费增量','The lifting charge adjusts the exchange rate provided by the selected service before it is saved. The exchange rates displayed in the table above include the lifting charge.'=>'手续费增量会在保存前调整所选服务提供的汇率。上表中显示的汇率已包含手续费增量。','Exchange rate = %s exchange rate x (1 + lifting charge / 100)'=>'汇率 = %s 汇率 x (1 + 手续费增量 / 100)','API key (required)'=>'API 密钥（必填）','Update frequency'=>'更新频率','Update manually now'=>'立即手动更新','You have to save all settings before updating exchange rates'=>'您必须在更新汇率之前保存所有设置','Manually'=>'手动','Hourly'=>'每小时','Daily'=>'每日','Weekly on'=>'每周','Monthly on the'=>'每月','Enter API key'=>'输入 API 密钥','WARNING! Minor limitations include 1000 requests/month limit and EUR being the only available base currency for customers using a free account. If you need more than 1000 requests per month or want to use all 170 available base currencies, you’ll need to choose one of the paid plans starting at only $10 per month.'=>'警告！次要限制包括每月 1000 次请求限制，且对于使用免费账户的客户，欧元是唯一可用的基准货币。如果您每月需要超过 1000 次请求或希望使用所有 170 种可用的基准货币，则需要选择每月仅需 $10 起的付费计划。','Updating the exchange rates on an hourly basis generates around 744 API calls a month. Please check that your exchange rates source can accommodate this higher usage.'=>'按小时更新汇率每月会产生约 744 次 API 调用。请检查您的汇率来源是否能容纳这种较高的使用量。','Last updated: %s'=>'最后更新：%s','Exchange rates updated successfully'=>'汇率更新成功','Visit website'=>'访问网站','Enable/disable'=>'启用/禁用','The multi-currency mode cannot be enabled as a specific currency was not set. Go to the %1$sWooCommerce settings%2$s page and select the default currency for your store.'=>'由于未设置特定货币，无法启用多货币模式。请前往 %1$sWooCommerce 设置%2$s 页面并为您的商店选择默认货币。','Enable the multicurrency mode'=>'启用多货币模式','Multicurrency documentation'=>'多货币文档','Custom prices'=>'自定义价格','Show only products with %1$scustom prices%2$s in secondary currencies'=>'仅显示在次要货币中具有%1$s自定义价格%2$s的产品','When enabled, products with prices based on the exchange rate are hidden'=>'启用后，将隐藏基于汇率定价的产品','The changes you made will be lost if you navigate away from this page.'=>'如果您离开此页面，所做的更改将丢失。','At least one currency must be enabled for this language!'=>'此语言必须至少启用一种货币！','Currency switcher options'=>'货币切换器选项','All currency switchers in your site are affected by the settings in this section.'=>'您站点中的所有货币切换器都会受此部分设置的影响。','Order of currencies'=>'货币排序','Additional CSS'=>'额外的 CSS','Widget Currency Switcher'=>'小工具货币切换器','Product page Currency Switcher'=>'产品页面货币切换器','Position'=>'位置','Actions'=>'操作','Action'=>'操作','Edit currency switcher'=>'编辑货币切换器','Add a new currency switcher to a widget area'=>'向小工具区域添加新的货币切换器','Your theme does not support a currency switcher widget. Please %1$sadd your currency switcher%2$s using a shortcode or PHP.'=>'您的主题不支持货币切换器小工具。请使用短代码或 PHP %1$s添加您的货币切换器%2$s。','Currency switcher preview'=>'货币切换器预览','Drag and drop the currencies to change their order'=>'拖放货币以更改其排序','Show a currency switcher on the product page template'=>'在产品页面模板上显示货币切换器','Edit Product Currency Switcher'=>'编辑产品货币切换器','New Widget Area Currency Switcher'=>'新建小工具区域货币切换器','Edit %s Currency Switcher'=>'编辑 %s 货币切换器','Which product attributes should be translatable?'=>'哪些产品属性应该是可翻译的？','WPML allows you to %1$stranslate your product attributes%2$s. Some attributes, like the ones based on numbers and codes, can be universal and might not need to be translated.'=>'WPML 允许您%1$s翻译您的产品属性%2$s。某些属性（例如基于数字和代码的属性）可以是通用的，可能不需要翻译。','Select which attributes in your store should be translatable:'=>'选择商店中哪些属性应该是可翻译的：','There are no attributes defined'=>'未定义任何属性','Continue'=>'继续','Go back'=>'返回','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce › Setup Wizard'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce › Setup Wizard','Let\'s make your WooCommerce store multilingual'=>'让我们让您的 WooCommerce 商店支持多语言','To get started, we need to set up the following:'=>'要开始使用，我们需要设置以下内容：','Create store pages in all your site\'s languages'=>'以您站点的所有语言创建商店页面','Choose which product attributes you want to translate'=>'选择您想要翻译的产品属性','Set your translation options'=>'设置您的翻译选项','Decide if you want to add multiple currencies to your store'=>'决定是否要为您的商店添加多种货币','Let\'s continue'=>'让我们继续','I\'ll do the setup later'=>'我稍后再进行设置','Do you want to add more currencies to your store?'=>'您想为您的商店添加更多货币吗？','You will be able to:'=>'您将能够：','Add a currency switcher to your store'=>'为您的商店添加货币切换器','Set exchange rates'=>'设置汇率','Create custom pricing in each currency'=>'为每种货币创建自定义定价','And more!'=>'以及更多！','Yes, enable multicurrency mode'=>'是，启用多货币模式','No, use only one currency'=>'否，仅使用一种货币','Make your store multilingual'=>'让您的商店支持多语言','Set up %1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce%2$s to translate your store and add more currencies.'=>'设置 %1$sWPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce%2$s 以翻译您的商店并添加更多货币。','Start the Setup Wizard'=>'开始 Setup Wizard','Click continue to create missing WooCommerce pages translate your store pages into the following languages:'=>'点击继续以创建缺失的 WooCommerce 页面，并将您的商店页面翻译成以下语言：','Click continue to translate your store pages into the following languages:'=>'点击继续以将您的商店页面翻译成以下语言：','WPML automatically generates translated versions of default WooCommerce pages, such as Shop, Account, Checkout, and Cart.'=>'WPML 会自动生成默认 WooCommerce 页面的翻译版本，例如商店、账户、结账和购物车。','Configuration Warnings'=>'配置警告','Your product permalink base is not translated to:'=>'您的产品固定链接基准尚未翻译为：','Translate URLs'=>'翻译 URL','Running WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce with default language other than English.'=>'运行 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 时使用的默认语言不是英语。','This may cause problems with URLs in different languages.'=>'这可能会导致不同语言的 URL 出现问题。','Change default language'=>'更改默认语言','There are some settings that require careful attention.'=>'有一些设置需要仔细留意。','Some settings from the WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce wpml-config.xml file have been overwritten.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 的 wpml-config.xml 文件中的某些设置已被覆盖。','You should check WPML configuration files added by other plugins or manual settings on the %s section.'=>'您应该检查由其他插件添加的 WPML 配置文件或 %s 部分的手动设置。','Multilingual Content Setup'=>'多语言内容设置','Media'=>'媒体','%s is not active.'=>'%s 未激活。','%s is not required in order to run WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce but it’s recommended if you want to use separate product images and galleries for different languages.'=>'运行 WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 并不强制要求安装 %s，但如果您想为不同语言使用独立的产品图片和图库，建议安装该插件。','%s is installed and active.'=>'%s 已安装并激活。','Secondary currencies: %s'=>'次要货币：%s','Multi-currency is not enabled.'=>'多货币未启用。','Add Currencies'=>'添加货币','Products Missing Translations'=>'缺失翻译的产品','%1$d %2$s translation missing.'=>'缺失 %1$d 个 %2$s 翻译。','%1$d %2$s translations missing.'=>'缺失 %1$d 个 %2$s 翻译。','Right now, there are no products needing translation.'=>'目前没有需要翻译的产品。','Plugins Status'=>'插件状态','%s is set up.'=>'%s 已设置。','%s is not set up.'=>'%s 未设置。','WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce depends on several plugins to work. If any required plugin is missing, you should install and activate it.'=>'WPML Multilingual & Multicurrency for WooCommerce 依赖多个插件才能工作。如果缺少任何必需的插件，您应该安装并激活它。','WooCommerce Store Pages'=>'WooCommerce 商店页面','To run a multilingual e-commerce site, you need to have the WooCommerce shop pages translated to all the site\'s languages. Once all the pages are installed you can add the translations for them from this menu.'=>'要运行多语言电子商务网站，您需要将 WooCommerce 商店页面翻译成网站的所有语言。安装所有页面后，您可以从此菜单中为它们添加翻译。','One or more WooCommerce pages have not been created.'=>'一个或多个 WooCommerce 页面尚未创建。','Install WooCommerce Pages'=>'安装 WooCommerce 页面','WooCommerce store pages do not exist for these languages:'=>'以下语言不存在 WooCommerce 商店页面：','Create missing translations'=>'创建缺失的翻译','These pages are currently being translated by translators via WPML: '=>'这些页面当前正由译者通过 WPML 进行翻译： ','WooCommerce store pages are translated to all the site\'s languages.'=>'WooCommerce 商店页面已翻译为站点的所有语言。','Taxonomies Missing Translations'=>'分类法缺失翻译','To run a fully translated site, you should translate all taxonomy terms. Some store elements, such as variations, depend on taxonomy translation.'=>'要运行完全翻译的站点，您应该翻译所有分类法术语。某些商店元素（如变体）取决于分类翻译。','%s do not require translation.'=>'%s 不需要翻译。','This taxonomy requires translation.'=>'此分类法需要翻译。','%1$d %2$s is missing translations.'=>'%1$d 个 %2$s 缺失翻译。','%1$d %2$s are missing translations.'=>'%1$d 个 %2$s 缺失翻译。','Translate %s'=>'翻译 %s','This taxonomy does not require translation.'=>'此分类法不需要翻译。','All %s are translated.'=>'所有 %s 均已翻译。','Right now, there are no taxonomy terms needing translation.'=>'目前没有需要翻译的分类法术语。','To configure product taxonomies or attributes as translatable or not translatable, go to the %1$sMultilingual Content Setup%2$s'=>'要将产品分类法或属性配置为可翻译或不可翻译，请转到 %1$s多语言内容设置%2$s','Original'=>'原文','Translation to'=>'翻译为','Product Shop Base'=>'产品商店基准','Original language'=>'原始语言','Update translation'=>'更新翻译','Add translation'=>'添加翻译','Edit translation'=>'编辑翻译','This page allows you to translate all strings that are being used by WooCommerce in building different type of urls. Translating them enables you to have fully localized urls that match the language of the pages.'=>'此页面允许您翻译 WooCommerce 在构建不同类型的 URL 时使用的所有字符串。翻译这些字符串使您能够拥有与页面语言相匹配的完全本地化的 URL。','You can enter or edit your default values on the %1$sPermalinks settings%2$s page or, for the endpoints, on the WooCommerce %3$sAdvanced settings%4$s page.'=>'您可以在 %1$s固定链接设置%2$s 页面输入或编辑您的默认值，或者在 WooCommerce %3$s高级设置%4$s 页面输入或编辑端点值。','permalinks settings'=>'固定链接设置','Account settings'=>'账户设置','Slug type'=>'别名类型','Original Slug'=>'原始别名','Shop page'=>'商店页面','Product base'=>'产品基准','Product category base'=>'产品分类基准','Product tag base'=>'产品标签基准','Product attribute base'=>'产品属性基准','Attribute slug: %s'=>'属性别名：%s','Product'=>'产品','Slug'=>'别名','Content / Description'=>'内容 / 说明','Excerpt'=>'摘要','Purchase note'=>'购买备注','Images'=>'图像','Custom Product attributes'=>'自定义产品属性','Value(s)'=>'值','Custom Fields'=>'自定义字段','Variations data'=>'变体数据','Download Files for Variation #%s'=>'下载变体 #%s 的文件','Download Files'=>'下载文件','File URL'=>'文件 URL','External Product'=>'外部产品','Product url'=>'产品 URL','Button text'=>'按钮文本','Changes in these translations will affect terms in general! ( Not only for this product )'=>'这些翻译的更改将影响通用术语！（不仅针对此产品）','Content, title, and excerpt are empty.'=>'内容、标题和摘要为空。']];